import LRA.VolumeI.AlgebraicStructures.CompleteOrderedField.ModelTheory.OrderedFieldTheory

namespace LRA.AlgebraicStructures.CompleteOrderedField.ModelTheory

/-!
First-order limitations for complete ordered fields.

Dedekind/LUB completeness quantifies over sets or cuts of the ordered field and
is not an ordinary first-order property of the ordered-field language. The
model-theoretic first-order content of a complete ordered field is therefore
its ordered-field reduct, not a first-order theory axiomatizing full
completeness.
-/

end LRA.AlgebraicStructures.CompleteOrderedField.ModelTheory
